/**
 * Translation schema for the mobile app's i18n catalog.
 *
 * Today most screens still ship with hardcoded English strings. The
 * namespaces below cover the M15–M17 employee surfaces (payslip viewer,
 * leave balance, profile lock) so the locale files have a structured
 * place to live. Adopting them at the call sites (replacing literals
 * with t('payslip.netPay') etc.) is a follow-up — not done in M19 to
 * avoid a large risky diff on screens that just shipped.
 *
 * Key namespaces here mirror the web at messages/{en,fr,mg}.json so
 * the same glossary review covers both surfaces.
 */
